== 2. a post binds, validates and renders its errors ==
ok   a clean post: 200 <html><body><form method="post" action="/notes/hello"><input type="hidden" name="__latte_token" value="<token>"><p class="title">Hello</p><p class="errors"></p><p class="ignored"></p><p class="owner">nobody</p></form></body></html>
ok   a post that fails both rules: 200 <html><body><form method="post" action="/notes/hello"><input type="hidden" name="__latte_token" value="<token>"><p class="title">H</p><p class="errors">title: title must be 2 to 10 characters | stars: stars must be between 1 and 5</p><p class="ignored"></p><p class="owner">nobody</p></form></body></html>
ok   a post missing a required field: 200 <html><body><form method="post" action="/notes/hello"><input type="hidden" name="__latte_token" value="<token>"><p class="title"></p><p class="errors">title: title is required</p><p class="ignored"></p><p class="owner">nobody</p></form></body></html>
ok   a post naming a field the author did not annotate: 200 <html><body><form method="post" action="/notes/hello"><input type="hidden" name="__latte_token" value="<token>"><p class="title">Hello</p><p class="errors"></p><p class="ignored">owner</p><p class="owner">nobody</p></form></body></html>
ok   a posted value is escaped where it renders
ok   and no tag reaches the document

